Note: This repository mirrors the stable upstream Linux kernel
Additional branches and configuration files are provided for servers and desktops.
Upstream sources remain unmodified in the clean-upstream branch.
---
All releases are signed with a subkey certified by the project's primary signing key. Users should verify the primary key fingerprint before trusting any signatures
